<title>USA: General Binding Corp Q4 net, sales rise.</title>
<headline>General Binding Corp Q4 net, sales rise.</headline>
<dateline>NORTHBROOK, Ill. 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fourth Quarter     Twelve Months</p>
<p>					1996     1995     1996     1995</p>
<p> Sales			  $142,156 $118,536 $536,836 $458,391</p>
<p> Income Before Taxes	  11,240    8,945   42,554   35,833</p>
<p> Income Taxes		    4,502    3,578   17,341   14,333</p>
<p> Net Income			6,738    5,367   25,213   21,500</p>
<p> Net Income Per Common Share  0.43     0.35     1.60     1.37</p>
<p>Average Common Shares Outstanding</p>
<p>				    15,746   15,735   15,743   15,740</p>
<p>(Unaudited - Dollars in Thousands, Except Per Share Amounts)  </p>
<p>Sales and earnings for 1996 exclude effects from General Binding's recent acquisition of Quartet Manufacturing Co, which became effective January 1, 1997.</p>
<p>	    ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8787))</p>
</text>
